<title>USA: Bikers Dream names Duffy and Day chairmen.</title>
<headline>Bikers Dream names Duffy and Day chairmen.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA ANA, Calif. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bikers Dream Inc said its board of directors appointed Donald Duffy and Rowland Day as co-chairmen and co-chief executive officers. They are currently directors of the company.</p>
<p>The company also said Richard King resigned as a director and secretary of the company.</p>
<p>Company officials were not immediately available to say who Duffy and Day replaced in their new positions.</p>
